From: thadk <thadk@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: Fix restricted matching in -c

Backport of upstream pull request #151 by thadk.

The -c option must restrict matches to paths below the current directory,
not paths that merely share its textual prefix.
---
diff --git a/z.sh b/z.sh
index c78f3cb..6a8ee1a 100644
--- a/z.sh
+++ b/z.sh
@@ -125,1 +125,1 @@
-                    c) fnd="^$PWD $fnd";;
+                    c) fnd="^$PWD/ $fnd";;
